<title>HONG KONG: Jiangxi Copper debuts at HK$2.80/share.</title>
<headline>Jiangxi Copper debuts at HK$2.80/share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of China copper producer Jiangxi Copper Co Ltd made their trading debut at HK$2.80 each on Thursday compared with their issue price of HK$2.55.</p>
</text>
